amily:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;(a) In 2025, GE Aerospace issued a total of $2,000 million in aggregate principal amount of senior unsecured debt, comprised of $1,000 million of 4.3% senior notes due 2030, and $1,000 million of 4.9% senior notes due 2036.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;See Note 20 for further information about borrowings and associated hedges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock>
